  "problem": "A new developer or agent could not install the actual eight-tool client from a clean copy. Plugin packaging could depend on the development checkout. Setup instructions could promise native WebMCP in unsupported browsers. Marketplace UI installation could be claimed without testing. A mocked dispatch function could be treated as final MCP evidence. HTTP 200 or a successful tool envelope could be treated as a completed research task.",
  "resulting_behavior": "A clean temporary installation initializes, lists eight tools and exits without depending on the development checkout. Instructions avoid promising native WebMCP in unsupported browsers; the HTTP route remains a tested fallback. Actual MCP stdio JSON-RPC journeys are retained with the exact plugin version. Marketplace UI installation is not claimed. No advertised tool is silently disabled or missing. plan_research remains disabled. A successful tool envelope is not a completed research task. HTTP 200 is not acceptance. worker/index.mjs does not import enrichment. Last-good generation live-2026-09-03-85b50522b420 is unchanged.",
